Fish: creative tabs and entries of mods (P8.5).

`Creative::load` reads `creative-inventory.json` once while the game loads its resources. The
tabs mods register and the entries they add to tabs go into that document before it is turned
into tabs, so they take the same path as the vanilla ones (stacks, search tab, icons).
`fish_lib::creative_patch` asks the loader (`Dispatch::creative_inventory`); the target is a
patch and not a hook because `from_json` returns `Result<Self>`, which horizon-mixins cannot
cancel, and its argument is a reference that cannot be replaced.

